; The language server as a pure library: strings in, strings out, no I/O. It
; links the three engine libraries so diagnostics come from the real parser,
; never a second one written for the editor; JSON comes from [writ_json], shared
; with the MCP server, and the JSON-RPC layer is hand-written against the stdlib. Files are grouped into layer folders (wire,
; doc, feature) for navigation; include_subdirs flattens them into the one
; [writ_lsp] library, so module names stay unqualified within it.

(include_subdirs unqualified)

(library
 (name writ_lsp)
 (libraries writ_data writ_syntax writ_runtime writ_json))
